n "The system corresponding to $M$ is \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y &=-2 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx-3y=-2.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=-2+3y,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=-2+3y \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2+3y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=⟨-2+3y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342073 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c87faa6-b893-53ba-92f4-903ccf2dd32d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339374} {:answer/id #uuid "359295b0-82ba-5167-85b6-7dd0bfdb6bf5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339603} {:answer/id #uuid "60eaf115-9b83-5456-8a7e-58465ef148d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339993} {:answer/id #uuid "64ccd9c1-b048-5406-90fe-2f5854979f7d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340021} {:answer/id #uuid "6ac239fb-67c1-5152-911c-d8d3251c0f0e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 16\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340075}] :